{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_17_level_main_17-16_end","groupId":"main_17","stageId":"main_17-16","title":"不曾怀疑","storyCode":"17-17","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_17-16_end.txt","sourceHash":"8f88a4dff49ff9f09afc575bc19bda6ae3b5074472a1347ac9db81e3aa610f2a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"塔露拉杀入保密区解救感染者，西尔卡则寻找着小将军的下落，而可露希尔在帮助感染者队伍之后，也终于和博士等人会合。面对失控的石棺，阿米娅透支力量阻止了爆炸，同时保住了复活凯尔希的希望。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g4_exurbstonewallstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"该死......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这些懦夫，各个都躲在掩体后面，我们不熟悉墙内地形，很难突破了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉还有多久能到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员B","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"她那边的敌人更多，估计还要点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员B","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"按照她的指示，我们只要尽可能地拖住这边的守军，等到她来增援就好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......什么动静——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"话音未落，另一枚炮弹越过他的头顶，朝着身后的其他成员而去。\n他刚想招呼自己的同伴们躲开攻击，一架无人机腾空而起，将炮弹拦截在半空，爆炸让地面都为之震动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这，这是......可露希尔？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着身后响起的机械嗡鸣，数不清的无人机依次升到了上空，呼啸着扑向飞来的炮弹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，才不用等到她来救场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你们帮忙拖了点时间，针对电磁干扰的解决方案也已经完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扫描掩体，标记敌方目标，自燃保护已解除——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，给他们点颜色看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无人机一架接一架越过了石墙大门，紧接着，掩体后响起阵阵爆炸声和乌萨斯军人此起彼伏的哀嚎。\n守军显然被这样毫无章法的攻击手段打乱了阵脚，他们慌忙用武器对付这些会飞行的铁块，已经顾不上隐藏自己的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这无人机怎么这么好用？要是我们也能用上这种——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，好机会，跟我冲进去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任务完成！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她情不自禁地打了一个响指。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g4_exurbstonewallstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我和大家提前搞定了这里，石墙的侧门已经被攻占了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过里面还有更多的守军，塔露拉，我需要你的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去找罗德岛的人吧，可露希尔，把乌萨斯的军队都交给我，整合运动来确保他们不会影响到你的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有很多账，要和这些人算。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g6_newundergroundcorridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>泽尔格勒保密区，？？？</><p=2>1102年1月22日 14:28</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......滋滋......呼叫......尼科诺夫上校......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......敌人突破了石墙防御，他们所到之处都燃起了大火，驻防连队也已经无人应答......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......请立即汇报你们的指挥部情况，燃料工厂是重中之重，要保护好那些感染者资源，绝不能失守！如果有危险，启动应急方案——"},{"type":"narration","text":"一只手伸过来，从倒下的男人怀里捡起了通讯器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么方案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捡到这个通讯器的人......你的上校，不久前死在了我的手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想干什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要知道，你是下一个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的五指猛然收紧，通讯器应声四分五裂，破碎的零件接连掉落在地上，发出清脆的细响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"搞定了，塔露拉，外面的残余士兵都已被处理。按照事先的计划，可露希尔前去寻找石棺，西尔卡则去寻找小将军的下落了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们要找的“燃料工厂”，抓到的几个俘虏说它就在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巧了......刚才他们的长官也这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把门打开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g7_newinstitutelaboratory"},{"type":"narration","text":"钢制大门被缓缓推开，里面排列着几十个等身的玻璃罐，一些人眯起眼睛，他们习惯了战场，却仍然恐惧于即将看到的事物。\n然而出人意料的是，这里和墙外的工厂并不全然相同，那些玻璃罐下红灯闪烁。塔露拉上前几步，观察着第一个罐中的情况。\n那是一名年轻的女人，她的躯体完整，无数根细长的软管连接着口鼻，体表的源石结晶正冒着暗黄色的微光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这些灯都亮着，和扩展地块那会儿不一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了！罐子里那个人的眼皮好像在动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们还有得救，先关了总闸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刺耳的拉闸声响起的同时，一阵刀光闪过。\n塔露拉面前的玻璃罩齐整地裂开，油状的保存液轰然涌出，在她脚边四溅。\n女人随着泄出的液体逐渐向前倒去，塔露拉上前一步扶住了她，另一只手扯断她身上所有的软管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她还有意识......快，去救其他人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"生的希望，让众人如梦初醒，方才的恐惧在这一刻化作力量，他们冲向其余的玻璃罐。一时间玻璃破碎声和招呼的声音此起彼伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我，得救了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，你很安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能向你保证，那些人绝不会再碰到你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一定是的......只有整合运动会救我们，我知道，大家都知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刚被转移到这里的时候，许多人，尤其是孩子都在哭......直到有人讲起你们的故事，大家，又开始相信了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但那些军官打断了我们，说整合运动只是疯子组建的恐怖组织......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但在乌萨斯，在乎感染者的人，哪会不是疯子呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是......那个白发的黎博利呢？她不是和你们一起的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？白发的黎博利？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在你们来之前，有一个白发的黎博利来过这里。她告诉我们一定要坚持下去，很快就会有人来救我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"获救的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她还说——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g7_newinstitutelaboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡谢娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_415_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永远不要放弃抗争，驯服的人会变得软弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡谢娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_415_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而只有拥有力量的人，才有资格活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g7_newinstitutelaboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，其他人都被救出来了，我们得抓紧了，别的工厂里还有感染者等我们去解救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，帮我搀着她，把她带出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个地方，由我来处理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"同伴搀走了这位虚弱的青年。塔露拉缓缓起身，她一步一步地走到门口，回过头。\n如今这座“工厂”空荡而寂静，倾翻的液体四处横流，倒映着远处最后一点微光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就像一场告别，塔露拉伸出了手——烈火从各个角落同时蹿起，吞没青色的石料。\n这场属于感染者的漫长徭役，在此刻终止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"72_g13_nobleroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_2249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"偌大的房间空无一人，只有尚在燃烧的壁炉，发出木屑破碎的声音。\n西尔卡走近书桌，书册和文件散落在上面，她翻动着，从底部拿出一张写满记号的纸张，右下角留有一个崭新的签名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_2249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿纳托利——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人？是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？奇怪......刚才还有声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，他感到后颈一紧，一股力量几乎让他双脚离地，随后把他狠狠掼在柱子上，砸出一声沉重的闷响。\n这孤单的卫兵还不及适应剧烈的眩晕与疼痛，刀尖就抵住了他的后心，隔着衣料，微微刺入皮肤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_2249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿纳托利的下落，或者你的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在几个小时前......小将军接到一个消息，就赶忙带着亲卫队离开了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_2249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他、他说，“那些败类不配染指泽尔格勒”，然后大发了一通脾气，说要把什么带走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_2249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“那些败类”？然后他去哪儿了？还待在城内吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在几个实验室转了一圈，都是和原型核心有关的，然后往城东去了......求您了，我完全不知道他在说什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_2249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_2249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以防万一，接下来你不能告诉任何人，我来过这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好，我绝对不会——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"话音未落，刀尖已经自他的胸膛破出，直直插进柱子。鲜血如注，顺着柱身蜿蜒而下。\n西尔卡振掉刀上的血液，朝着窗外看去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_2249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“原型核心”，就是他们所说的“石棺”吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g8_reactor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"石棺被拆毁......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"石棺现在，到底是什么状态？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在乌萨斯的认知当中，石棺可以作为一个巨型能量源来使用，除此之外的部分，都是不必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的研究员没有办法突破凯尔希留下的封锁程序，所以选择对石棺进行了暴力破解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就现在来看，和我们之前最坏的猜想一样，石棺的生物修复功能被破坏得很彻底......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们还有任何机会吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"难道没有任何希望了吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们能完整回收这里的设备，就还有一线可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可现在更紧急的情况是，石棺整体的控制系统已经遭到了非常严重的损坏！状态非常不稳定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然......这一段时间以来，研究所一直依赖大量的源石来勉强维持石棺的稳定，现在源石无以为继，石棺也处在失控的边缘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"石棺直到现在还在不断向外泄漏那种可以让人感染的生物粉尘，它的能量输出也非常不稳定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果石棺中蕴藏的能量完全不受控地释放出来，后果恐怕不只是整个泽尔格勒被夷为平地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr！我们还有机会关闭石棺吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在努力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有办法直接开启凯尔希留下的开关，得先从完整构建控制系统开始——总之，我还需要一定时间！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是外面的士兵！他们还在试图强行闯入这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是整座建筑都在受到攻击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是第一集团军，他们难道准备完全销毁这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死！这些鲁莽的乌萨斯人做事完全不考虑后果的吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着整栋建筑的一阵震动，无数样貌怪异的生物源源不断地从石棺核心涌出。\n它们似乎也感到茫然与恐惧，在这方密闭的空间里四处流窜奔逃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是那天晚上见到的那种生物——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，Raidian！千万当心别被那些东西碰到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，要是我能腾出手就好了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，你还需要多少时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是......四十分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别分心，我来保护阿米娅和博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小戴乌，要勉强你们一下了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，外面有动静，大门可能要被突破了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士躲在我身后，我来戒备——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，那是熟悉的电信号——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i23"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......赶上了！我是不是来得正是时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！我就知道你们一定可以成功的！但是我在见到你们之前真的很担心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g8_reactor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸......这些满地乱爬的是什么东西？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当心！那些感染生物很危险，千万不要被它们碰到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我应该怎么办？它们会爆炸吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你帮我控制它们的活动范围，可我的小赛柯携带的弹药不是很充足......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来只是火力不足吗？那倒好办了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“零号油罐”！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着一声令下，整齐的无人机阵列在可露希尔身后升空，仿佛组成了一道密不透风的墙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之前觉得这套攻击算法太残忍了，所以一直没有投入实战来着......现在总算派上用场了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正好来试验一下我刚刚装载的武器模块......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“零号油罐”，识别攻击目标，精准歼灭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g8_reactor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔！你是怎么进来的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天才黑客工程师当然有办法了！虽然也少不了遇到的一些帮手就是了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且小古米拿到的识别码也派上了用场，博士，你绝对猜不到我在石墙外面碰到了谁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你安全就好......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"之后告诉我。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士你们果然找到石棺核心了，我们是不是终于可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔！帮帮我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！没问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难得见到Mon3tr这么紧张的样子，现在到底是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"石棺马上就要爆炸了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g8_reactor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......没事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去多长时间了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多，一个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信她们吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Raidian与可露希尔的无人机共同构筑起的防线，将危险的感染生物控制在一个安全范围内。\n在房间的另一端，Mon3tr与可露希尔依然在操作台前忙碌着。\n每个人都沉默着，没有人敢对那个未知的结果发问。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有结果了吗！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"情况，怎么样......？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对不对不对不对——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们明明做了那么多实验研究，我们对石棺应该已经非常了解了才对，可怎么会——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可露希尔依然不住地喃喃着，石棺并没有回应她的努力，兀自不停运转着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#cc0000>错误</color>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......石棺的状况，已经到极限了。我们已经没有时间通过程序来终止它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在最后的机会，是在它完全失控，造成灾难性的后果之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......彻底毁掉它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......该做决定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......如果凯尔希还在的话，她也会同意这样做的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mon3tr用尽可能平静的语气，下达了最残酷的判决。\n已经没有时间了。\n“石棺”不再是可以带回同伴的希望，而是一个可能毁灭一切的威胁。\n尽管你们曾经都怀有真挚的希望，可是现在，需要你亲自做出决定，放弃最后一丝可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在犹豫什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少见你这样毛手毛脚的，走神了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我在担心，去了乌萨斯的大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直等一个悬而未决的结果，一点也不好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可从来没有当着博士的面表现出这种情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想影响士气，不代表不在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你年纪和我一样大的时候，就知道这种分别是什么滋味了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不是个好的祝福......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......这样一来工程部的重建也算完成了吧，真是了不起的大工程！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到博士和阿米娅，带凯尔希医生回来的时候，一定会被震惊的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实是了不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不想说扫兴的话，你这么肯定博士会成功？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信小兔子，还有博士。就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一定要有什么理由才能相信彼此，也没有必要当精英干员了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们应该为大家准备欢迎派对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像往常一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你到底还要将那些秘密隐瞒到什么时候？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们讨论过这件事，我以为我们已经达成了共识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能像索要一杯咖啡一样要求别人交还你的记忆，一切经他人之口转述的都不是客观事实。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你打算一直旁观我被蒙在鼓里？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"一个失忆的人很难处理工作。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，并不是只有你一个人在忍受着事与愿违的烦躁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在将来的某一天，你会理解我的耐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会主动对你谈及你的过去，但我会为你提供除此之外的一切必要帮助。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有时候我都分不清......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你到底是在意我，还是想找我的麻烦。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的确在意你，远超你的想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我说过的——我会克制自己的情感，不会让我对你的恨意或是别的情绪，影响我的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我会一直保护你，直到你捡回记忆，或者找到你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那时，我们才能谈论你存在于这里的意义。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经找到自己了，对吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经清楚了自己的责任，知道自己坚持的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就去做你一直以来认为是正确的选择吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“保护这片大地上的生命”......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛不会因为某个人的缺位而停下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们会拥有不一样的未来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g8_reactor"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Mon3tr......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就按你说的——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，你刚刚做什么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......我什么都没有做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可为什么这里的系统，会突然出现一个权限层级这么高的后门？如果这里始终存在一个后门，为什么那些研究员会发现不了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对不对，这里不只是一个权限漏洞......为什么石棺的操作系统中，会存在一个独立运行的程序，就像PRTS一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然很缓慢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它的确在阻止石棺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"AMa-10？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"凯尔希？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想修好它，和你一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"AMa-10不仅承载了我们共同的期待，它还保存了一段对我而言极为关键的记录。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g8_reactor"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可以追踪到那段程序吗！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经在这样做了！只是还需要一点时间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五分钟......不，有没有办法再争取三分钟就好！我还可以试一试！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，石棺现在的状态非常危险，我不确定它还能维持多长时间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......我们能通过压制石棺的能量，来让它稳定下来呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这绝对是不可能的，哪怕是你也不可能以一己之力对抗石棺的能量输出！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不试试......又怎么能知道呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我能感受到，黑王冠在回应我的呼唤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，我能做到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅小姐......你愿意来帮我了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的请求违背了特蕾西娅为我设置的底层指令——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何时候，优先保护阿米娅你的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅小姐，可是你也说过，不要做会让自己后悔的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你确定要这么做吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次......我一定会尽自己全部的努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想再失去身边任何一个人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i14_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"古老的巨构发出恐怖的嗡鸣，仅仅是站在它的周遭，你都能感到自己的五脏六腑在随之颤抖。\n根本无从想象，这个仪器当中到底蕴含着多么恐怖的能量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅向石棺伸出了手，黑色的法术从她的指尖流淌而出，在一瞬间，的确压制住了那股凶暴的力量，石棺核心变得安静下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没事的......不用担心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那一天......是凯尔希医生挡在了我的前面，我不会忘记......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每一次，都是你们站在我的身前保护我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这次......我绝对不会再放手了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可以——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_i14_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你再一次亲眼见证，阿米娅瘦小的身体爆发出无比强大的力量。\n你伸出手去扶住女孩的身体，你也清楚地感受到了汹涌的情绪，那是阿米娅力量的源头。\n不可动摇的决意，无数的遗憾，对离别的畏惧......还有对那些如今仅存在于回忆里的温情，深沉的不舍。\n你们共同走过了很漫长的路，你们一样都失去了许多。\n你努力地搀扶住阿米娅的肩膀，想要像往常一样安抚她的情绪，分担她的痛苦......可是那股力量，那汹涌的情绪仿佛无穷无尽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你分明听到了，某样器物碎裂的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"还要坚持多久！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很快......不，已经好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，已经可以了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"停下来了，但是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"73_g10_protocolsetnet"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这里......是什么地方？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员","整合运动成员A"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["整合运动成员B"]}]}
